templates.turnaround:
{STYLE}
FORMAT: character model sheet, landscape 16:9 (2048x1152), flat dark ink-navy background. Three full-body views of the SAME character standing side by side at EXACTLY the same height on one ground line: FRONT, SIDE (facing right), BACK. Neutral relaxed standing pose, arms slightly away from the body, empty hands. Props listed below drawn separately on the right edge. Same ink line and flat two-step shadows as the hero art, lighting identical in all three views. Small English labels under each view only: FRONT, SIDE, BACK, PROPS; the character's English name small at top left. No other text.
SUBJECT: {subject}
PROPS: {props}
LIGHT: rim light {rim}.

templates.expressions:
{STYLE}
FORMAT: dialogue portrait sheet, landscape 3:2 (1536x1024), three half-body portraits of the SAME character side by side, cropped at the waist, each turned three-quarters toward the viewer, same costume and lighting, dark background, no text. These are the busts used in the conversation screen, so faces must be large, clear and strongly acted.
SUBJECT: {subject}
EXPRESSIONS, left to right: {expressions}.
LIGHT: rim light {rim}.

